Subject: Declare only the OS time types in so.h
Upstream-base: f75ccf1ad20e5bd7585962990db08067c0ae498a

so.h needs OSTime only for the SOPoll timeout. OSTime.h also includes
OSHardware.h, whose native OSContext and OSThread headers forward to
Aurora's <dolphin/os/...>. A host translation unit that only wants the
SO declarations, such as the socket backend, then needs Aurora's
prepared headers and fails without them ('dolphin/os/OSContext.h' file
not found). OSTime_fwd.h declares the time types alone; the SO
declarations are unchanged.

diff --git a/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/so.h b/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/so.h
index 6a7dbdd..18cacb2 100644
--- a/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/so.h
+++ b/libs/RVL_SDK/include/revolution/so.h
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@
 #include <revolution/types.h>
 #include <revolution/so_fwd.h>
 
-#include <revolution/os/OSTime.h>
+#include <revolution/os/OSTime_fwd.h>
 
 #ifdef __cplusplus
 extern "C" {
